{"t_ms": 253.2, "dir": "<-", "bytes": 716, "message": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"cacheScope": "private", "contents": [{"mimeType": "text/markdown", "text": "# Gift cards\n\n## Buying a gift card\nWe sell gift cards from 25 to 500 dollars. You cannot buy a gift card with another gift card.\n\n## Using a gift card\nGift cards never expire and have no fees. You can check the balance in your account.\n\n## Lost cards and returns\nWe can replace a lost gift card if you give us the order number of the purchase.\n\nGift cards cannot be returned or exchanged for cash, except where the law requires it.\n", "uri": "policy://larkfield/gift-cards"}], "resultType": "complete", "ttlMs": 0, "_meta": {"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo": {"name": "support-mcp", "version": "1.0.0"}}}}}
